Monitor and control a SpaceX Starlink dish from the OPNsense web UI using
the dish's local gRPC API (no extra packages required).

Shows live status, alerts, throughput/latency history and the obstruction
map. Lets you wake the dish (optionally for a set time), manage the sleep
schedule in local time with automatic daylight-saving correction, reboot,
stow/unstow, toggle GPS and set snow melt mode.
